EN, per FIN-212), but the code actually rounded halves up (`ROUND_HALF_UP`). So `round_money(Decimal(\"2.665\"))` gave 2.67 instead of the 2.66 the test expects.\n- **Fix:** On a new branch, `fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding`, I changed the rounding setting to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, in one commit (`08d3cd5986`).\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/102\n\nI haven't merged it, because merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}